stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Clean
  Clean --> Dirty: Edit shortlist or reorder route
  Clean --> List: Browser Back
  Dirty --> Leaving: Browser Back or Back to deals or Back to deal tours
  Leaving --> Dirty: Keep editing and restore editor history entry
  Leaving --> List: Leave and discard edits
  Dirty --> Saving: Save edits
  Saving --> Saved: Receipt and detail arrive
  Saving --> Dirty: Save refused
  Saved --> List: Browser Back
  List --> Opening: Open tour
  Opening --> Creating: Start a tour and invalidate prior request
  Opening --> Clean: Current detail arrives
  Creating --> Creating: Discard stale Open success or failure
  Creating --> SavingCreation: Submit creation with current generation
  SavingCreation --> Clean: Current creation and detail arrive
  SavingCreation --> Creating: Current creation refused
  %% never Discard dirty edits without an in-app departure decision
  %% never Let an older Open or creation response replace a newer editor
